(a) As provided in this article, every vehicle stopped or parked upon a roadway shall be stopped or parked parallel to the curb or edge of the roadway, and in the direction of authorized traffic movement.
(b) As provided in this article, every vehicle stopped or parked upon a roadway shall be stopped or parked with the right-hand wheels parallel to and within twelve (12) inches of the curb or as practicable to the edge of the right-hand shoulder.
(c) As provided in this article, no vehicle shall stop, stand, or park:
